"│ #  Results → count every row (runs a count query)                            │"
"│ +  Results pane → taller                                                     │"
"│ -  Results pane → shorter                                                    │"
"│ F  Table → filter by value                                                   │"
"│ I  Result detail → Cell / Row                                                │"
"│ S  Table → sort by this column too (up, down, off)                           │"
"│ [  Result tabs → previous                                                    │"
"│ ]  Result tabs → next                                                        │"
"│ a  +Copy all fetched rows                                                    │"
